{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The task requires verifying after mutation that every selected song is liked, but the available public Spotify read APIs expose only queue and playback state and provide no liked-state field or read endpoint. The mutation response alone cannot satisfy the required post-mutation re-query verification.","missing_public_schema_fields":["A public Spotify read API or response field that reports whether a song is liked, queryable by song ID or included in current-song/queue records."],"task_id":"ccb4494_1","task_family":"ccb4494","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"Cannot produce a compliant executable plan because the requested liked-state postcondition is not publicly observable after mutation.","steps":[]}